This EPx8 takes a walk around the blocks of Blues ❯ Folk ❯ Jazz ❯ LoFi ❯ Dub, to celebrate Hammy's move (and life) SHOWsutra style, because it's funny because it's true: Hammy (and his daddy, whose name is not Clyde haha) got a new house on Clyde Avenue. And so now, it's "Hammy On Clyde"!

